# Igris USER — your local override surface

This file lives at `~/.igris/USER.md`. It's preserved across `igris init --upgrade`
operations byte-for-byte. Use it for personal notes that should NOT live in any
project repo (because the brain is per-user, not per-project).

## User identity

- name: {{USER_NAME}}
- email: {{USER_EMAIL}}

## Notes

This file is YOURS. Igris will never overwrite it. The only operation that
touches USER.md is the very-first `igris init` (which writes the initial
template); subsequent `igris init --upgrade` runs preserve it byte-for-byte.

Edit freely — Igris reads this file for display only, not for runtime behavior.
